    "chunk_text": "\u00e6g\u00feer ge & \u00fea foron \u00fea men \u00e6fter ut of \u00fe\u00e6re byrig, & eac \u00fea \u00fee him utan comon to fultume, & gefliemdon \u00dea \u00fe\u00e6s forhra\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s ilcan h\u00e6rfestes for Eadweard cyning mid West Sexna fierde to Passanhamme, & \u00fea se firdstemn for ham, \u00fea for o\u00feer ut, & gefor \u00fea burg \u00e6t Huntandune, & hie gebette & \u00dea giet \u00e6fter \u00feam \u00fe\u00e6s ilcan geres foran to Martines m\u00e6ssan for Eadweard cyning mid West Sexna & eal se here on East Englum him swor annesse, \u00fe\u00e6t hie eal \u00fe\u00e6t woldon \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde, & eall \u00fe\u00e6t & se here \u00fee to Grantanbrycge hierde hine geces synderlice him to hlaforde & to mundboran, & Her on \u00f0ysum gere betweox gangdagum & middan sumera for Eadweard cyng mid firde to & \u00fea on \u00fe\u00e6m setle \u00f0e he \u00fe\u00e6r s\u00e6t, \u00fea ge for \u00e6\u00feelfl\u00e6d his swystar \u00e6t Tamewor\u00feige xii nihtum \u00e6r & \u00fea gerad he \u00fea burg \u00e6t Tame wor\u00feige, & him cierde to eall se \u00feeodscype on Myrcnalande \u00fee & \u00fea cyningas on Nor\u00fe Wealum, Howel, & Cledauc, & Ieo\u00fewel, & eall Nor\u00fe Weallcyn hine sohton \u00dea for he \u00feonan to Snotingaham & gefor \u00fea burg, & het hie gebetan & gesettan, \u00e6g\u00feer ge mid & him cierde eall \u00fe\u00e6t folc to \u00fee on Mercnalande geseten w\u00e6s, \u00e6g\u00feer ge Denisc ge Englisce. Her on \u00feysum ge",
